  "title": {
    "zh": "儿童城堡帐篷拼搭积木套装（100PCS）",
    "en": "Kids Castle Fort Building Set (100PCS)"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款面向儿童创意拼搭场景的城堡帐篷积木套装，采用杆件与连接球结构，可快速搭建房屋、帐篷和堡垒造型，适用于家庭亲子互动与课堂活动。\n\n品牌为尧顺，主要材质为PP，常用规格为YG100pcs，支持反复拆装和多次重构。",
    "en": "This is a kids castle-fort building set for creative construction play. With rods and connector balls, children can quickly build house, tent, and fort shapes for parent-child interaction and classroom activities.\n\nBrand: Yaoshun. Main material: PP. Typical model: YG100pcs. The set supports repeated assembly and reconfiguration."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款儿童城堡帐篷拼搭积木套装采用“杆件+连接球”组合设计，孩子可根据空间与主题自由拼接房屋、帐篷与堡垒结构，适合多场景创意搭建。",
      "产品主材为PP，结构轻便并支持重复拆装。拼搭过程中可用于手眼协调、空间认知与亲子协作训练，适用于家庭娱乐和幼教活动。",
      "商品采用彩盒包装，常规规格为YG100pcs，便于电商上架与渠道分销。支持批量采购与长期供货。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This kids castle fort set uses a rod-and-connector design, allowing children to build houses, tents, and fortress shapes based on different play themes and space sizes.",
      "The main material is PP, offering lightweight handling and repeatable assembly. The building process supports hand-eye coordination, spatial learning, and parent-child collaboration for home and preschool scenarios.",
      "Packed in a color box with a common YG100pcs specification, this item is suitable for e-commerce listing, channel distribution, bulk procurement, and long-term supply."
    ]
  },
